---
const stats = [
  { n: '5', l: 'Specialty clinics' },
  { n: '1,000+', l: 'Instruments tracked' },
  { n: '0', l: 'Compliance breaches' },
];
---

<section id="about" class="sec" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="wrap sec-grid">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="label"><span class="num">01</span>About</span></div>
    <div class="sec-body reveal">
      <h2 id="about-h">I run the room before anyone <em>notices something&rsquo;s wrong.</em></h2>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I work full-time at <strong>Penn Dental Medicine</strong> coordinating clinical operations across five specialty
          clinics while finishing my B.A.A.S. in Leadership and Communication at Penn. My scope runs from instruments and
          vendor coordination to documentation, training, and cross-department communication, daily, across 200+ dental
          students, 30+ residents, and 30+ faculty.
        </p>
        <p>
          The environment has zero tolerance for error. It built my ability to operate independently, align stakeholders
          across clinical and administrative functions, and design processes that hold up without hand-holding.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="stats">
        {stats.map((s) => (
          <div class="stat"><dt class="label muted">{s.l}</dt><dd><b>{s.n}</b></dd></div>
        ))}
      </dl>

      <p class="label">
        <span class="num">&#9670;</span>
        Outstanding Service Award, Penn Dental Medicine, presented by the graduating class
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
